	(text "EoS RL78G13 Board, rev A. Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava.\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nUSB-only power. Header VDD is 3.283 V output; disable target power on an external probe.\nJP1: 1-2 RUN/user reset; 2-3 E1/E2 reset. Connect the debug cable with power off.\nJ1/J2: R01UH0243ED0000 pp.18-20 pinout, p.70 dimension callouts only; original 2.54 mm end offset.\nSources: R01DS0131EJ0380, R01UH0146EJ0380, R20UT1994EJ0940; CP2102N Rev.1.5; TPS7A91 SBVS282A.\nExternal VDD loads share 150 mA only after CP2102N Max Power=0xFA and host configuration\n(130 mA with an E1/E2/E2 Lite fitted); before configuration or with the factory 100 mA\ndescriptor, keep external load <=50 mA. USB suspend current is not met (VBUS bleed 3.33 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 260 440 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5708e654-cf75-545a-a4c4-f5941bcc9b0e")
	)
